{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019cat86DvAvYuneHENxQvBN","type":"tool_result","content":"C:/Users/john/AppData/Local/Temp/pytest-of-john/pytest-2184/test_distinct_projects_distinc0/A/.anchor/projects/287084abc8e7457b89d679b3aebdeff8/discovery.json\n---README---\n# .anchor/ — Anchor R&D per-project store\r\n\r\nThis directory is created and managed by Anchor's R&D control surface. Each\r\nregistered project gets an isolated namespace at:\r\n\r\n    .anchor/projects/<project-id>/\r\n        research/      planning/      build/      deliverables/      jobs/\r\n\r\nMultiple projects may share one folder; each has its own `<project-id>` subtree,\r\nso their stores never collide.\r\n\r\n## Tracking policy (C9 git-trackable vs C10 no-leak)\r\n\r\n- **Tracked (C9):** small JSON *pointer-records* that index efforts/versions —\r\n  these are committed so effort history is durable across restarts.\r\n- **Ignored (C10):** raw job logs, large generated artifacts (PDF), and any\r\n  `raw/` payloads that could carry absolute paths, tokens, or personal data.\r\n  The distribution build (Wave 8) additionally scans for and refuses to ship\r\n  anything under `.anchor/`.\r\n\r\nSee the sibling `.gitignore` for the exact rules.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04a194dd-e183-4903-a2b4-0348fae42d1b","uuid":"00087070-2d01-4dd7-be5c-121325a9c9b7","timestamp":"2026-06-25T01:12:21.644Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"C:/Users/john/AppData/Local/Temp/pytest-of-john/pytest-2184/test_distinct_projects_distinc0/A/.anchor/projects/287084abc8e7457b89d679b3aebdeff8/discovery.json\n---README---\n# .anchor/ — Anchor R&D per-project store\r\n\r\nThis directory is created and managed by Anchor's R&D control surface. Each\r\nregistered project gets an isolated namespace at:\r\n\r\n    .anchor/projects/<project-id>/\r\n        research/      planning/      build/      deliverables/      jobs/\r\n\r\nMultiple projects may share one folder